/**
 * podcheck-api — companion API for PodCheck (Turn vape-package authenticity PRE-SCREEN).
 * Sep 7 2026. Bindings: AI (Workers AI), DB (D1 podcheck-db), EVIDENCE (R2 podcheck-evidence).
 *
 * Doctrine baked in:
 *  - Never says "real" or "fake". Tri-state bands: likely_authentic / could_not_verify / signs_of_counterfeit.
 *  - Only the official turnapp scan is proof. Every result says so.
 *  - Deterministic factors dominate; the visual factor is CAPPED at 10 until a genuine reference set exists.
 *  - Unavailable factors are EXCLUDED from the denominator (never scored 0 silently). Each factor carries `status`.
 *  - Stores nothing on /analyze except an anonymous outcome row (band, score, factor statuses). Images are stored
 *    ONLY on /report, EXIF-stripped, with the user's explicit action.
 *  - Reports are DRAFTED for the user to send. This worker never contacts Turn or the DCC.
 */

